Z||000000||maryjane||11-16-2001||10:28 PM||||Many years ago Santa was preparing for his Christmas delivery, but problems were everywhere. Some of the elves were sick and the elves from the temp service couldn't produce toys well enough to keep on schedule. Then Mrs. Claus announced that her mother would be coming to visit for the holidays. When Santa went to hitch up the reindeer, he found several in the act of giving birth-more delay. He climbed onto the sleigh, and the floorboard broke thru. Disgusted, he went in to get some coffee and a shot of whiskey. He discovered the elves had been into his bottle and it was empty, & then dropped the coffeepot and broke it into a thousand pieces. About this time, the doorbell rang. Thourghly disguted now, and cussing, he went to the door and found a little Angel standing there with a Christmas Tree. "I've brought you a Christmas Tree Santa, isn't it beutiful? Where would you like me to stick it?"<BR>Thus was started the tradition of impaling an Angel on the top of a Christmas Tree.||||reg||1
